// Zone data. The encounter director, the director map and content gating all read this file.
//
// Every zone has tags (kind, region, star class, danger grade, free tags) and a list of circles.
// Free tags also say what lives there: "nebula" and "gas-giant" (and the asteroid and
// derelict POIs) are where the space fauna cards in deck.json can turn up.
// Coordinates are metres in the zone's own frame; circles are measured on the X/Z plane, the plane
// the map shows. Circle kinds:
//   territory  NPC faction territory: sets the faction mix of events. Unclaimed space has none.
//   poi        a point of interest (station, asteroid field...) that events can anchor to.
//   base       a player base. Nothing spawns inside it.
//   nospawn    nothing spawns inside it.
